{"id":"wb-8-64","name":"岗上遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"岗上遗址","text":"岗上遗址，位于山东省枣庄市滕州市东沙河镇岗上村，是一座古遗址，为中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n1977年12月23日，授予山东省文物保护单位。2019年10月，该遗址列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B2%97%E4%B8%8A%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86839031,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86839031","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3b28738fabbeea2e284b939c.jpg","title":"Hangzhou_Liangzhu_Museum_2015.08.02_15-21-37.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hangzhou_Liangzhu_Museum_2015.08.02_15-21-37.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/Hangzhou_Liangzhu_Museum_2015.08.02_15-21-37.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"杭州良渚博物院“东夷华彩”大汶口文化·龙山文化特展——\n\n红陶实足鬶，大汶口文化，滕县岗上村出土，山东博物馆藏","width":320,"height":213}}